An upstream include outside the URLPattern subset (a '*' inside a host
label): Compile fails, naming the set and rule.
-- ops --
jappend rules/brave/clean-urls.json [] {"include": ["*://exa*mple.com/*"], "exclude": [], "params": ["fixture_param"]}
relock
run Compile
fail brave/clean-urls:*://exa*mple.com/*
